    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d276">

                <pb facs="0411" n="295" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg295"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1759.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-21T10:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 21, 1915—10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>According to Government announcements confirmed from other sources, Feliu and
                    fifty-two followers have surrendered with arms at Santiago and Feliu is to leave
                    first opportunity for abroad. Government has also announced that rebel leaders
                    in east will not be granted guaranties.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
